The lefts is a list of 1, 3, 3, 1, and 2.
The bottoms is a list of 1, 1, 2, 3, and 3.
The rights is a list of 3, 4, 4, 2, and 3.
The tops is a list of 3, 2, 4, 4, and 4.
The last is 4.
The minleft is item 0 of lefts.
The maxright is item 0 of rights.
The minbottom is item 0 of bottoms.
The maxtop is item 0 of tops.
The area is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The left is item spot of lefts.
The right is item spot of rights.
The bottom is item spot of bottoms.
The top is item spot of tops.
The width is right minus left.
The height is top minus bottom.
Add (width times height) to area.
If left is less than minleft, set minleft to left.
If right is more than maxright, set maxright to right.
If bottom is less than minbottom, set minbottom to bottom.
If top is more than maxtop, set maxtop to top.

The boxwidth is maxright minus minleft.
The boxheight is maxtop minus minbottom.
The boxarea is boxwidth times boxheight.
The good is 1.
If area is not boxarea, set good to 0.
The leftmax is 0.
The rightmin is 0.
The bottommax is 0.
The topmin is 0.
For every first from 0 to last.
For every second from 0 to last.
If second is at most first, skip to the next one.
Set leftmax to item first of lefts.
If item second of lefts is more than leftmax, set leftmax to item second of lefts.
Set rightmin to item first of rights.
If item second of rights is less than rightmin, set rightmin to item second of rights.
Set bottommax to item first of bottoms.
If item second of bottoms is more than bottommax, set bottommax to item second of bottoms.
Set topmin to item first of tops.
If item second of tops is less than topmin, set topmin to item second of tops.
The width is rightmin minus leftmax.
The height is topmin minus bottommax.
If width is more than 0 and height is more than 0, set good to 0.

If good is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
